#### Time Of Flight detector (TOF)

The TOF is designed to measure the time of flight for charged particles. It is another important device for particle identification, especially at low momentum [67, 68, 69]. The TOF covers \(2\pi\) in azimuth direction and \(|\eta|<0.9\) in psedu

