The VPD consists of two identical parts installed in the East and West of the STAR, located near the beam pipe. The distance of either slide of the VPD alone the Z direction respect to the center of STAR is 5.7 m, and the pseudo-rapidity acceptance is \(4.24\leq|\eta|\leq 5.1\). It not only can provide for the start time measurement, but also be used as a primary detector for minimum bias trigger, and vertex position measurement alone the Z direction, the vertex Z can be calculated as the following 2.2[70]:

