#### Nuclear modification factors \(R_{aa}\) for D- and B-decayed electrons

The inclusive open heavy flavor decay electron (D- and B- mesons ) nuclear modification factor (\(R_{AA}\)) was extracted in Au+Au collisions at \(\sqrt{s_{NN}}\)=200 GeV. The p+p reference from the previous analysis using data from Run 2012 as shown in Fig. 3.21, The Au+Au data is from STAR Run 2014, but without HFT. The inclusive non-photonic eletrons nuclear modification \(R_{AA}^{HF}\) shows on Fig. 4.26[104], Both the Run 2014 and Run 2010 measurements are used the same Run 2012 p+p reference, two results are consistent with.

